Package: movesr
Type: Package
Title: Portable MOVES Emission Factor Engine
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Sergio", family = "Ibarra-Espinosa",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zergioibarra@gmail.com"))
Description: A standalone R port of the USEPA MOVES on-road emission-rate
    engine: running and start exhaust, brake and tire wear, evaporative
    permeation, vapor venting and fuel leaks, and chained pollutants. The
    MOVES default database is read from Parquet through the DuckDB
    command-line tool; no Java, MariaDB or MOVES installation is needed.
    Factors can be exported for inventory models such as vein.
License: GPL (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/atmoschem/movesr
BugReports: https://github.com/atmoschem/movesr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: data.table
Suggests: testthat, xml2
RoxygenNote: 7.1.1
